<title>UK: Oester kommunalkredit sets $75 mln four-year bond. [CORRECTED 12:32 GMT]</title>
<headline>Oester kommunalkredit sets $75 mln four-year bond. [CORRECTED 12:32 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects headline from &quot;five-year&quot; to &quot;four year&quot;.)</p>
<p>- The following bond was announced by lead manager Generale Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   OESTERREICHISCHE KOMMUNALKREDIT AG</p>
<p> AMT    $75 MLN	 COUPON     6.00	MATURITY    23.JAN.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.64    PAY DATE    23.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    100.24    SPREAD	+10 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/AUS</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 HOME CTRY  AUSTRIA   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC  1.4	 PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND JANUARY 2001 UST</p>
<p> NOTES    SENIOR, UNSECURED.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
